                                            <!-- ========================= SKILLS ========================= --> 
                                             <section id="skills" class="section section-alt"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading center reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> CORE SKILLS & EXPERTISE </p> <h2> Front-End, Back-End & Business Knowledge </h2> </div> <div class="skills-grid"> <div class="skill-box reveal"> <h3> Front-End </h3> <div class="skill"> <span>HTML5</span> <div> <b style="width:90%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>CSS3</span> <div> <b style="width:85%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>JavaScript</span> <div> <b style="width:80%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>Responsive Design</span> <div> <b style="width:90%"></b> </div> </div> </div> <div class="skill-box reveal"> <h3> Back-End </h3> <div class="skill"> <span>PHP</span> <div> <b style="width:85%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>MySQL</span> <div> <b style="width:85%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>CRUD & Business Logic</span> <div> <b style="width:85%"></b> </div> </div> <div class="skill"> <span>Git & GitHub</span> <div> <b style="width:70%"></b> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p class="skills-note"> My skills continue to improve through continuous learning, practice and project development. </p> </div> </section> <!-- ========================= WORKING PROCESS ========================= --> <section id="process" class="section"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading center reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> MY WORKING PROCESS </p> <h2> From Requirement to Working Solution </h2> </div> <div class="process-grid"> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>01</b> <h3>Understand</h3> <p> Understand the business, users and requirements. </p> </div> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>02</b> <h3>Plan</h3> <p> Plan the features, database and workflow. </p> </div> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>03</b> <h3>Design</h3> <p> Create a clean, responsive interface. </p> </div> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>04</b> <h3>Develop</h3> <p> Build the front-end, back-end and database. </p> </div> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>05</b> <h3>Test</h3> <p> Test functionality, usability and workflows. </p> </div> <div class="process-step reveal"> <b>06</b> <h3>Deliver</h3> <p> Prepare the solution for real-world use. </p> </div> </div> <!-- ACCOUNTING CYCLE --> <div class="accounting-cycle reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> MY ACCOUNTING APPROACH </p> <h3> Accounting Cycle </h3> <div class="cycle-list"> <span>1. Identify Transactions</span> <span>2. Record Transactions</span> <span>3. Post to Ledger</span> <span>4. Prepare Trial Balance</span> <span>5. Adjust Entries</span> <span>6. Prepare Financial Statements</span> <span>7. Review & Reconcile</span> <span>8. Close the Period</span> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ========================= PRICING ========================= --> <section id="pricing" class="section section-alt"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading center reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> STANDARD STARTING PRICES </p> <h2> Simple Packages </h2> <p> Starting prices only. Final pricing depends on features, complexity and integrations. </p> </div> <div class="pricing-grid"> <!-- STARTER --> <article class="price-card reveal"> <small> STARTER </small> <h3> Business Website </h3> <strong> ₱8,000 <span>– ₱15,000</span> </strong> <p> For small businesses, professionals and personal brands. </p> <ul> <li>Up to 5 pages</li> <li>Responsive design</li> <li>Contact form</li> <li>Mobile optimization</li> <li>Basic SEO structure</li> </ul> <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline"> Request a Quote </a> </article> <!-- PROFESSIONAL --> <article class="price-card featured reveal"> <div class="popular"> POPULAR </div> <small> PROFESSIONAL </small> <h3> Business Website </h3> <strong> ₱18,000 <span>– ₱35,000</span> </strong> <p> For businesses needing a stronger online presence. </p> <ul> <li>8–10 pages</li> <li>Custom design</li> <li>Interactive features</li> <li>Social integration</li> <li>Basic SEO</li> </ul> <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary"> Request a Quote </a> </article> <!-- SYSTEM --> <article class="price-card reveal"> <small> BUSINESS SYSTEM </small> <h3> Web Application </h3> <strong> ₱35,000 <span>– ₱70,000+</span> </strong> <p> For POS, inventory and management systems. </p> <ul> <li>Custom dashboard</li> <li>Login & authentication</li> <li>Database</li> <li>CRUD functionality</li> <li>Reports</li> </ul> <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline"> Request a Quote </a> </article> <!-- ECOMMERCE --> <article class="price-card reveal"> <small> COMMERCE </small> <h3> E-Commerce </h3> <strong> ₱50,000 <span>– ₱100,000+</span> </strong> <p> For businesses ready to sell online. </p> <ul> <li>Products & cart</li> <li>Checkout</li> <li>Order management</li> <li>Shipping integration</li> <li>Payment integration</li> </ul> <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline"> Request a Quote </a> </article> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ========================= WHY WORK WITH ME ========================= --> <section class="section"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading center reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> WHY WORK WITH ME? </p> <h2> Professionalism Behind Every Project </h2> </div> <div class="why-grid"> <div class="why-card reveal"> <b>01</b> <h3> Professionalism </h3> <p> Respect, responsibility, communication and commitment. </p> </div> <div class="why-card reveal"> <b>02</b> <h3> Work Ethics </h3> <p> Honesty, accountability, consistency and continuous improvement. </p> </div> <div class="why-card reveal"> <b>03</b> <h3> Quality Results </h3> <p> Functional, organized, responsive and user-friendly solutions. </p> </div> <div class="why-card reveal"> <b>04</b> <h3> Problem Solving </h3> <p> I focus on using technology to solve real business problems. </p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ========================= FUTURE GOALS ========================= --> <section class="section section-alt"> <div class="container future-box reveal"> <div> <p class="eyebrow"> FUTURE GOALS </p> <h2> Building Today. Growing Tomorrow. </h2> <p> My goal is to build long-term relationships with clients, strengthen my full-stack development skills and create reliable solutions that provide real value to businesses. </p> </div> <div class="goals-list"> <span> 01 · Grow through real client projects </span> <span> 02 · Build scalable applications </span> <span> 03 · Learn modern technologies </span> <span> 04 · Help businesses go digital </span> </div> </div> </section> <!-- ========================= CONTACT ========================= --> <section id="contact" class="contact-section"> <div class="container contact-grid"> <div class="contact-info reveal"> <p class="eyebrow"> LET'S CONNECT </p> <h2> Have an idea? Let's build something useful. </h2> <p> Tell me about your website, business system or application. I would be happy to learn about your project. </p> <div class="email-box"> <small> EMAIL </small> <a href="mailto:jerdeleon316@gmail.com"> jerdeleon316@gmail.com </a> </div> </div> 
